# A mill grinds the grains the castle sends it: the miller stands inside from the start, two grains lie on the castle's flag, a carrier takes
# them over the road to the mill's flag and on into the mill, the miller grinds each in two stretches, and the flour goes back to the castle.
# The script fast-forwards to the castle's first flour and takes a shot of the mill and its road. Run it on the layout with the
# install; its expect values are the History Edition's (play/basic-production.play runs the food chains on the basic set):
#   sh tools/play-run.sh mill --layout layouts/mill.jsonc --fps 10
wait 0.3
expect flour = 0
expect-at 13 10 mill
fast-forward until flour >= 1 max 30000
scroll up 6 860 560
wait 0.3
dump flour-stored
shot flour-stored
expect flour >= 1
